er}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-17T21:10:14Z","updated_at":"2025-06-17T21:10:14Z","body":"And what do you mean by \"reload from disk\"?\r\nBoth using Reload Saved Scene option and reloading after external change properly updates the selection.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2981842400/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2981929146","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107067#issuecomment-2981929146","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107067","id":2981929146,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6xvKC6","user":{"login":"nikitalita","id":69168929,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY5MTY4OTI5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/69168929?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nikitalita","html_url":"https://github.com/nikitalita","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nikitalita/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nikitalita/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nikitalita/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nikitalita/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nikitalita/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nikitalita/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nikitalita/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nikitalita/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nikitalita/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-17T21:46:00Z","updated_at":"2025-06-17T21:46:00Z","body":"In our particular use case, which is a version control plugin, we have to manually call `reload_scene` when checking out a new branch or updating from remote to get the currently edited scene to update in the editor, since the editor will likely still be in focus when the files are updated and it won't reload the scene (unless the editor is re-focused and prompts the user, which is a rather bad user experience). It's in this particular context where we're seeing this.\r\n\r\nIn either case, do you have an issue with the logic here? if the node currently being inspected in the Inspector dock is null, and the item being pushed with `push_node_item` is also null, we should push that item so that the selection gets cleared; is that in question?","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2981929146/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2981968753","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107067#issuecomment-2981968753","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107067","id":2981968753,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6xvTtx","user":{"login":"KoBeWi","id":2223172,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjMxNzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2223172?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi","html_url":"https://github.com/KoBeWi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-17T22:05:46Z","updated_at":"2025-06-17T22:05:46Z","body":"When reviewing bugfixes, I always try to reproduce the bug first and then verify if it's really fixed. It helps to better understand the problem. I didn't even look at the code yet.\r\n\r\nI tried calling `reload_scene()` manually (using EditorScript) and still can't reproduce the crash.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2981968753/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2982050026","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107067#issuecomment-2982050026","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107067","id":2982050026,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6xvnjq","user":{"login":"nikitalita","id":69168929,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY5MTY4OTI5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/69168929?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nikitalita","html_url":"https://github.com/nikitalita","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nikitalita/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nikitalita/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nikitalita/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nikitalita/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nikitalita/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nikitalita/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nikitalita/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nikitalita/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nikitalita/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-17T22:51:26Z","updated_at":"2025-06-17T22:51:26Z","body":"Understood; I think we may be hitting some sort of a race condition that doesn't really appear in normal use (perhaps, in normal use, the inspector dock gets updated *after* the editor selection gets updated for the node docks?).\r\n\r\nYou could try this: Select a node, and then select a resource so that the inspector tab gets pointed to a non-node item, then delete that node outside of the editor, reload the scene","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2982050026/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2986025420","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107067#issuecomment-2986025420","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107067","id":2986025420,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6x-yHM","user":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other